<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech's VAI gets Spanish order.</title>
<headline>VA Tech's VAI gets Spanish order.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voest-Alpine Industrieanlagenbau (VAI), a subsidiary of VA Tech, said on Friday it had been awarded a contract worth over 200 million schillings to supply a tube welding line for A.G. Tubos Europa of Spain.</p>
<p>VAI said in a statement the order represents the biggest tube and pipe mill contract ever executed by VAI.</p>
<p>The plant is scheduled to begin operations in the fourth quarter of 1998. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
